    <rdfs:label>food (filled)</rdfs:label>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Food material which contains an outer layer and inner core of different food materials, and which is the output of a food filling process.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>filled</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>stuffed</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
