  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002667">
    <rdfs:label>allspice</rdfs:label>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Allspice is the dried unripe fruit (berries, used as a spice) of Pimenta dioica, a midcanopy tree native to the Greater Antilles, southern Mexico, and Central America, now cultivated in many warm parts of the world.</obo:IAO_0000115>
